      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00779",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“好了，算了吧，这种话就不说了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "All right, forget it, let us not talk about that anymore...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00779",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "比这要紧的是，您下来一趟，我们慢慢地坐着聊怎么样？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "More importantly, why do you not come down for a while, and we can sit and talk things over calmly?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00779",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "绝对不使坏心思。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "We absolutely will not try anything underhanded.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00779",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "就是想干，也是寡不敌众，赢不了的……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even if we wanted to, we would be outnumbered and could not win...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00779",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "跟您说定了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So it is settled between us.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
